  "rationale": {
    "purpose": "Economy is one logical-server currency owner with a per-world dormant switch, safe native merchant extensions and exact recipe-generation policy.",
    "decision_source": "User explicitly requested execution of the Universal Standalone plan on 2026-10-21, with repository plan amendments and Windows/Linux/macOS portability.",
    "user_requested": "One shared production implementation for integrated/dedicated worlds, source-domain ownership, optional feature absence, Economy ON/OFF, preserved native IDs/saves/behavior, dedicated opt-in events, content-aware progression/quests, Bootstrap in shareable pack.",
    "codex_choices": "Domain adapters, exact generation-bound recipe reconciliation, per-world frozen progression profile, native quest folder projection and source/resource routing implement that approved contract. No implicit player acceptance is asserted."
  },
